      <activity id="4b3c8a58-a7e3-519f-9216-ae5d82e73fe1" activityNameId="523b130b-f9c9-52b3-b3c0-77a2c137dca0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, winter 2018, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, winter 2018, at grid
Transmission losses are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.;
UUID: 46bf704c-552a-366e-8256-441e979577d3
This dataset describes the transmission of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Germany in winter 2018 and includes the high voltage network infrastructure (including long-distance transport), transmission losses and air pollutant emissions. Not included are electricity losses due to long-distance transport since they are assumed to be contained in the total electricity losses of the country network.
Location: Germany
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_46bf704c-552a-366e-8256-441e979577d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
